      "body": "Smoke desktop part 14 on this head, against a site published from dev 64e83fcd plus this change: 138 passed, 2 failed.\n\n- **The frame at the 1904 spawn is inside the draw budget (T-1739): still red, 4,600,545 triangles against 4,600,000** (5,113 draw calls). Dev itself has grown since my first spawn reading. Draw calls went from 4,643 to 5,113 with the background drafts, so the 0.05 \u2192 0.03 far share isn't enough on today's dev.\n- Zero page errors: the only errors are `ERR_TUNNEL_CONNECTION_FAILED` on `kevinrhaas.github.io/chicago-images` thumbnails. This container's proxy blocks that host, so this one is not this PR's.\n\nA further elm-only trim is next on this branch. It is checked in a tree viewer A/B at mid, far and distant range, and every stem still reaches its crown:\n\n- far: 2 % of the clumps\n- far: three-sided wood, no limb under 10 cm\n- mid: no twig under 4.5 cm (as the phone already does)\n- distant: no limb under 16 cm\n\nI'll post the spawn reading here before pushing.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
